

**11.1.24 \(\int_{z}^{a}\frac{\mathscr{C}_{0}(t)dt}{t}\!\!=\!\!\frac{2g_{1}(x)\mathscr{C}_{0}( x)}{x^{2}}\frac{g_{0}(x)\mathscr{C}_{1}(x)}{x}\)**

where

\[g_{0}(x)\!\sim\!\sum\limits_{k=0}^{\infty}(-)^{k}\left(\frac{x}{2}\right)^{-2k} \!\!(k!)^{2},\]

\[g_{1}(x)\!\sim\!\sum\limits_{k=0}^{\infty}(-)^{k}\left(\frac{x}{2}\right)^{-2k} \!\!l(k\!+\!1)!\]

\[g_{0}(x)\!=\!2x^{2}\!\!\int_{x}^{a}\frac{g_{1}(t)dt}{t}\!